omp-web (0.5.51) jammy; urgency=medium

  * Typing in the hidden-models overview filter no longer crashes the page
    (#154). 0.5.50 matched allow-list globs with `Bun.Glob`, a global that
    exists only in the Bun runtime, so the first keystroke threw `Bun is not
    defined` in the browser and unmounted the app. The filter now uses a
    browser-safe matcher, and a provider-anchored pattern such as
    `Anthropic/*` lists that provider only instead of also matching the same
    models re-sold through OpenRouter.
    The filter understands the full `enabledModels` glob syntax (`[5-9]`,
    `?`, nested `{a,b}`, whole-segment `**`), pinned against `Bun.Glob`, so
    a pattern pasted from the allow-list selects the same rows as the server.

